// (b) dilation: quadrant-only (axial cross never dilated), for each EDGE pixel write
// DILATED(99) at offsets (±j, ±k), j,k in [1, dilation], over WHITE/BLACK only —
// EDGE and already-DILATED pixels are never overwritten. Out-of-bounds writes are
